{"id":"n51119-1-7","stage":5,"title":"들어맞다 · 说中","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n51119-1-7-1","ko":"네 예상이 들어맞았어.","zh":"你的猜测没错。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"네","meaning":"“너의(你的)”的缩略语。","explanation":"네：“너의(你的)”的缩略语。","readings":[{"term":"네","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"84427","senseId":"1","lemma":"네","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"네","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3"}},{"text":"예상이","meaning":"预想","explanation":"예상：预想；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"예상","audio":"/audio/d558732dc8ee759f5ce5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70522","senseId":"1","lemma":"예상","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"예상이","audio":"/audio/ea10b3b4644721f5a094.mp3"}},{"text":"들어맞았어.","meaning":"说中，应验","explanation":"들어맞다：说中，应验；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"들어맞다","audio":"/audio/1f9f9b938bf2ffa796f0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"51119","senseId":"1","lemma":"들어맞다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"들어맞았어","audio":"/audio/9988817734a3f745bbe4.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"1c0ddfd005093840","term":"네","zh":"“너의(你的)”的缩略语。","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3","entryId":"84427","definition":"“너의(你的)”的缩略语。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"d558732dc8ee759f","term":"예상","zh":"预想","audio":"/audio/d558732dc8ee759f5ce5.mp3","entryId":"70522","definition":"预测将来的事情或状况；或指那样的内容。","pronunciation":["예ː상"]},{"id":"1f9f9b938bf2ffa7","term":"들어맞다","zh":"说中，应验","audio":"/audio/1f9f9b938bf2ffa796f0.mp3","entryId":"51119","definition":"确切地符合先前的想法或言语等。","pronunciation":["드러맏따"]}],"audio":"/audio/e3a6f69498fea8605c41.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n51119-1-7-2","ko":"그것 봐. 내가 기다리면 집값이 오를 거라고 했잖아.","zh":"看吧，我就说只要我等着，房价就会上涨的。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"그것","meaning":"那个","explanation":"그것：那个。","readings":[{"term":"그것","audio":"/audio/49ef044188dcd25ecf37.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"31953","senseId":"2","lemma":"그것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그것","audio":"/audio/49ef044188dcd25ecf37.mp3"}},{"text":"봐.","meaning":"推测","explanation":"보다：推测；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61190","senseId":"20","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"봐","audio":"/audio/fdcffec86114c54dd4e0.mp3"}},{"text":"내가","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"내가","audio":"/audio/7ee3e480d2ca3192b2bc.mp3"}},{"text":"기다리면","meaning":"等，等待","explanation":"기다리다：等，等待；면：表示条件或假设：“如果、若、……的话”。","readings":[{"term":"기다리다","audio":"/audio/1f9765247406d52d5aaa.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62264","senseId":"1","lemma":"기다리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"기다리면","audio":"/audio/2f9a36a1a9443bedda82.mp3"}},{"text":"집값이","meaning":"房价","explanation":"집값：房价；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"집값","audio":"/audio/9dd02d163ab300ca77ee.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"78368","senseId":"1","lemma":"집값","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"집값이","audio":"/audio/cccffa592ea23639184b.mp3"}},{"text":"오를","meaning":"上升，上涨","explanation":"오르다：上升，上涨；ㄹ：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"오르다","audio":"/audio/8fdeb9822b3fa0617051.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69518","senseId":"10","lemma":"오르다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"오를","audio":"/audio/cc468a959410bdd8646a.mp3"}},{"text":"거라고","meaning":"表示说话人的推测或信念等。","explanation":"거：表示说话人的推测或信念等；이다：表示“是”的判断形式；라고：引用命令或名词判断；要与前后引用表达连用。","readings":[{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62331